 <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm mt-2">From <strong>August 12, 2026</strong>, PPWR requires a packaging authorized representative and online marketplaces (Amazon, etc.) will verify packaging EPR registration. Many importers register only the battery stream and face enforcement for missing WEEE and packaging obligations. <strong>Verify all three registrations before your next shipment.</strong></p>
